WEBVTT

00:12.762 --> 00:14.431
I've been thinking.

00:14.514 --> 00:15.348
Yes?

00:16.474 --> 00:19.394
You said the Wunderkinder run
the Church of Eternal Salvation.

00:19.936 --> 00:22.814
If they can do it, why can't we?

00:23.356 --> 00:25.316
We're miracle children,
I mean, adults too.

00:26.401 --> 00:28.862
Has your dream evolved
from con artist to cult leader?

00:29.446 --> 00:32.699
If the entire congregation
each gave a 10,000-won offering,

00:33.199 --> 00:34.325
how much would that be?

00:34.951 --> 00:35.952
Not to mention tithes.

00:36.036 --> 00:39.914
And those who offer up their entire
life savings to live communally.

00:39.998 --> 00:41.124
Roughly speaking…

00:43.835 --> 00:46.838
Sheesh, I can't even do the math.

00:46.921 --> 00:50.633
Hey, if we play our cards right,
we could make more money than Uri Geller.

00:50.717 --> 00:53.470
I don't want to use my powers
on something like that.

00:53.553 --> 00:55.597
You're too naive.

00:55.680 --> 00:58.058
-This is your problem.
-Seriously?

00:58.141 --> 01:00.852
Powers are meant to be used.

01:01.603 --> 01:04.230
What's taking Lady Trainwreck
and Mr. Oddball so long?

01:04.731 --> 01:06.941
I can't just clock out before dessert.

01:07.484 --> 01:08.318
Quiet.

01:09.110 --> 01:10.445
I am being quiet.

01:10.528 --> 01:11.446
My phone's ringing.

01:18.119 --> 01:19.079
Hello?

01:20.830 --> 01:21.706
Hey!

01:22.248 --> 01:23.666
I'll take this call outside.

01:28.963 --> 01:31.049
Yes, Mother. Have you had dinner?

01:32.092 --> 01:33.343
Me? You know, same old.

01:33.426 --> 01:35.970
Well, the guys at City Hall

01:36.054 --> 01:39.516
kept begging and begging,
asking me to please help out with work.

01:40.016 --> 01:41.476
No, I'm a freelancer.

01:41.976 --> 01:45.063
These days, all the really talented folks
work freelance.

02:01.704 --> 02:03.081
One second, Mom.

02:14.926 --> 02:16.469
Mom, I'll call you back.

02:17.971 --> 02:20.223
She teleports when her heart beats fast.

02:21.349 --> 02:23.184
As long as her heart doesn't beat fast,

02:24.018 --> 02:25.562
that woman can't do anything.

02:53.423 --> 02:55.550
OUR MASTER
MAY YOU ALSO MASTER HAPPINESS

03:48.228 --> 03:51.856
THE WONDERFOOLS

03:53.149 --> 03:57.320
EPISODE 6
ALL ROADS LEAD TO CHAE-NI

03:58.738 --> 04:00.949
However, our shepherd has told us,

04:01.032 --> 04:03.576
"Everything is possible
for the one who believes."

04:04.619 --> 04:06.037
Today, right here,

04:06.120 --> 04:08.164
we will witness the glory of a miracle.

04:08.873 --> 04:10.500
Through the marked one,

04:10.583 --> 04:12.502
our shepherd Kim Pal-ho.

04:13.127 --> 04:14.128
Today,

04:14.754 --> 04:16.673
before our very eyes,

04:16.756 --> 04:18.758
our brother will stand tall
on his two feet.

04:20.009 --> 04:21.886
-I believe.
-I believe.

04:30.103 --> 04:31.020
Jae-won.

04:42.949 --> 04:43.783
He stood up!

04:59.966 --> 05:01.134
Believe!

05:01.217 --> 05:06.097
A living faith will make us stand tall.

05:06.180 --> 05:10.810
And it shall deliver us
from the dominion of death.

05:14.147 --> 05:15.815
It's a miracle!

05:24.073 --> 05:26.326
Amen! It's a miracle!

05:26.409 --> 05:27.827
-Hallelujah!
-Amen!

05:27.910 --> 05:33.166
Heaven and earth will pass away,
but my words will never pass away.

05:33.791 --> 05:36.502
-The prophecy of the end draws near.
-It's a miracle!

05:36.586 --> 05:40.214
And only a few
tickets to salvation remain.

05:40.298 --> 05:44.177
Show us your sincerity.
Show us your conviction.

05:44.260 --> 05:45.845
Hallelujah!

05:50.183 --> 05:51.601
Hallelujah!

05:51.684 --> 05:53.144
Hallelujah!

05:54.354 --> 05:56.147
Hallelujah!

05:57.440 --> 05:59.859
Amen!

05:59.942 --> 06:02.320
Shepherd!

06:13.498 --> 06:14.874
Their end goal is money.

06:16.501 --> 06:19.379
They're using the Wunderkinder's powers
to perform miracles.

06:21.089 --> 06:22.548
Witnessing these miracles,

06:22.632 --> 06:25.843
the congregation blindly believes
they're revelations from God.

06:26.552 --> 06:29.430
Dozens of new members
are joining the church every day.

06:30.890 --> 06:32.433
Ha Won-do, that fellow.

06:33.142 --> 06:36.896
He found those poor children again
and is using them to panhandle.

06:37.397 --> 06:41.275
And it's clear enough
what he'll try to do with that money.

06:41.776 --> 06:45.780
But he'll need more than just money
to start the experiments again.

06:46.697 --> 06:50.118
Don't you think there must be
someone more powerful behind all this?

07:13.933 --> 07:14.767
What's going on?

07:14.851 --> 07:17.812
He is currently carrying out
a crucial but dangerous revelation.

07:17.895 --> 07:21.649
He'd like the shepherd and you two sisters
to stay inside until he gives the word.

08:16.746 --> 08:18.915
Inject more of the drug
before she wakes up.

08:19.624 --> 08:21.292
We don't know how much she's had.

08:22.335 --> 08:23.169
It may be fatal--

08:38.476 --> 08:41.062
So there really was a successful subject.

08:41.145 --> 08:43.981
Inject the maximum dose.
It doesn't matter if she dies.

08:44.065 --> 08:45.983
And tie the specimen up just in case.

08:54.784 --> 08:57.328
What?

08:57.995 --> 08:59.956
What is this?

09:01.415 --> 09:03.834
What the… What is this?

09:04.961 --> 09:07.380
What… Damn it, where…

09:10.091 --> 09:11.634
This looks like…

09:13.678 --> 09:18.307
one of those secret labs you see
in cartoons, run by a mad scientist.

09:19.934 --> 09:21.227
This must be that place.

09:22.228 --> 09:24.146
The main branch of Boon the King Duck!

09:24.230 --> 09:25.314
Prepare more drugs.

09:25.398 --> 09:26.232
Yes.

09:29.860 --> 09:30.820
You.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.154
I saw you.

09:32.238 --> 09:33.197
That's right.

09:33.281 --> 09:35.825
I can tell you're the boss around here.

09:36.450 --> 09:37.702
Oh, come on!

09:37.785 --> 09:41.414
Why would you kidnap me like this?
Are you nuts?

09:41.998 --> 09:43.332
I had something to retrieve.

09:44.667 --> 09:45.501
Retrieve?

09:45.585 --> 09:48.004
Your heart belongs to someone else.

09:55.803 --> 09:57.179
Hey, lady.

09:57.680 --> 10:00.099
What's with the service here, huh?

10:00.600 --> 10:02.852
Aren't you going to offer me coffee
or something?

10:03.769 --> 10:07.732
Or black tea, or green tea, or something?

10:07.815 --> 10:10.985
Don't you have anything with caffeine?

10:11.819 --> 10:13.029
COFFEE JELLY

10:22.496 --> 10:24.081
Hold it! Wait.

10:24.832 --> 10:26.459
Give me some time to think.

10:30.504 --> 10:32.632
Is this jelly caffeine-free?

10:33.507 --> 10:35.176
Hey, wait.

10:37.094 --> 10:39.722
Here it comes!

10:39.805 --> 10:41.223
Here it comes!

10:42.892 --> 10:45.478
She's over there! Get her!

10:46.062 --> 10:47.938
-Why's it so…
-Hurry! Grab her!

10:49.106 --> 10:50.232
-She's there!
-Get her!

10:50.316 --> 10:51.609
-That way!
-There she is!

10:52.193 --> 10:54.236
Catch her!

10:54.320 --> 10:55.404
Don't come any closer.

10:55.488 --> 10:56.447
Get her!

11:00.576 --> 11:01.869
Back off!

11:05.831 --> 11:08.000
Man, this is driving me crazy.

11:08.084 --> 11:10.086
Hold it right there.

11:10.169 --> 11:11.671
Time out!

11:16.801 --> 11:18.803
-What the heck?
-She just disappeared.

11:19.679 --> 11:20.846
Where did she go?

11:26.936 --> 11:29.271
PERSONAL RECORD CARD
3972

11:37.863 --> 11:40.533
It looks like the side effects
are getting to you too.

11:41.534 --> 11:43.619
You know it's only
a matter of time, don't you?

11:46.205 --> 11:48.165
Just bring me the Child of Eternity.

11:48.666 --> 11:50.334
Then you can live too.

11:53.087 --> 11:54.046
It turns out…

11:56.132 --> 11:57.717
that you have family.

12:07.852 --> 12:09.812
SERIAL NUMBER: 3972
NAME: KO EUN-SAN

12:24.285 --> 12:26.203
FATHER: KO MIN-SEOK
DECEASED

12:26.287 --> 12:29.707
MOTHER: JANG YUN-HUI
DOMESTIC RESIDENCE

12:59.945 --> 13:02.573
I finally found you, Master.

13:06.869 --> 13:08.037
Why did you do it?

13:08.788 --> 13:10.623
Why did you do that to me?

13:14.084 --> 13:15.336
I won't say

13:16.670 --> 13:17.630
I'm sorry.

13:26.096 --> 13:27.598
Is this why you were nice to me?

13:29.266 --> 13:30.226
Yes.

13:30.309 --> 13:31.894
That heart.

13:32.812 --> 13:36.732
If not for that, you would never
have helped us to begin with?

13:39.193 --> 13:40.027
I wouldn't have.

13:44.448 --> 13:45.366
Come with me.

13:45.991 --> 13:47.743
Come with me and fix this.

13:48.410 --> 13:50.412
If I go over there again,

13:50.913 --> 13:53.457
I have nowhere else to run to.

13:54.542 --> 13:57.127
Master, go and fix it for me.

13:58.838 --> 14:00.923
I thought you were on my side,

14:01.006 --> 14:02.508
no matter what!

14:07.513 --> 14:08.430
What's this, then?

14:10.474 --> 14:11.976
COFFEE JELLY

14:21.986 --> 14:26.323
Instead of giving me this, you shouldn't
have handed me over in the first place!

15:17.249 --> 15:18.459
No!

15:20.920 --> 15:21.754
Come on!

15:22.254 --> 15:24.715
You should have brought him with you!

15:26.091 --> 15:28.052
Why's my damn nose running now?

15:29.428 --> 15:30.679
It can't be helped.

15:30.763 --> 15:32.139
Since it's come to this…

15:34.266 --> 15:37.269
I'm going to have to find
my own way to survive--

15:39.229 --> 15:42.274
Lee Un-jeong, you son of a…

16:24.066 --> 16:27.403
Don't let her get too drowsy or too alert.

16:27.486 --> 16:31.156
Just keep her heart beating
slowly but steadily.

16:31.240 --> 16:32.449
Understood.

16:40.124 --> 16:42.543
After all that criticism about what I did

16:42.626 --> 16:45.295
with sick children
and how I should pay for my sins,

16:46.088 --> 16:48.090
it seems your grandmother
wasn't any better.

16:49.425 --> 16:50.843
You're wrong.

16:52.511 --> 16:54.179
My grandma

16:55.097 --> 16:57.725
knows what she did wrong.

16:58.684 --> 17:00.352
But you people

17:01.228 --> 17:02.688
damn well don't.

17:03.689 --> 17:07.443
Don't lump her in with you
because it's insulting.

17:07.526 --> 17:09.611
Simply by sacrificing your life,

17:09.695 --> 17:12.448
we could save so many others.

17:15.034 --> 17:17.327
Do you think
your grandma would accept that?

17:18.162 --> 17:19.621
No, she wouldn't.

17:19.705 --> 17:21.915
She'd just want to save you.

17:22.583 --> 17:24.835
Even if it meant
all those people would die,

17:24.918 --> 17:26.462
she'd want to save you.

17:29.173 --> 17:30.883
But the question is…

17:33.177 --> 17:36.555
are you someone who's worth taking away

17:37.056 --> 17:38.515
other people's chances?

17:41.268 --> 17:43.729
Are you someone
who has a definitive reason to live,

17:43.812 --> 17:46.940
even if it means forgoing countless lives?

17:48.567 --> 17:50.194
Are you really that worthy?

17:56.617 --> 17:57.534
No.

17:58.035 --> 17:59.995
You're nothing.

18:00.496 --> 18:02.623
You aren't worthy.

18:04.083 --> 18:04.917
You

18:06.376 --> 18:09.463
do not deserve that heart.

18:28.107 --> 18:28.941
Cheong!

18:29.691 --> 18:31.193
Honey! Cheong!

18:31.693 --> 18:32.778
We saved this for you.

18:32.861 --> 18:33.862
Great. Thanks, Cheong.

18:34.905 --> 18:37.616
It's dangerous. We have to go now.
Let's hurry and pack.

18:38.659 --> 18:40.994
What nonsense are you up to now?

18:41.495 --> 18:43.122
Where would we go?

18:43.622 --> 18:46.708
Don't you know Dad by now?
He wants to go on a trip.

18:49.336 --> 18:51.547
That's not it. We're in grave danger.

18:51.630 --> 18:55.134
We need to go somewhere else.
How about your parents' home?

18:55.217 --> 18:57.761
What's so dangerous
about this place and how?

18:57.845 --> 19:00.639
Just ask him where he wants to go.
That'd be quicker.

19:02.558 --> 19:03.809
Cheong, listen carefully.

19:04.768 --> 19:05.894
The truth is that I,

19:06.603 --> 19:08.647
for reasons I can't disclose,

19:08.730 --> 19:11.108
gained an ability that I can't disclose.

19:11.608 --> 19:13.110
Some people I can't name

19:13.193 --> 19:16.280
might do something terrible to me
that I can't disclose, so--

19:16.363 --> 19:17.281
Did you get a loan?

19:17.364 --> 19:20.826
No, I didn't! Oh, for crying out loud!

19:21.577 --> 19:22.452
That's not it!

19:24.454 --> 19:28.167
Fine. I admit that I've never been
very reliable. I apologize for that.

19:28.250 --> 19:30.502
But can't you just, for once…

19:30.586 --> 19:32.963
Can't you just trust me for once?

19:33.046 --> 19:35.174
How dare you throw the phrase

19:35.674 --> 19:37.718
"for once" in my face again?

19:38.802 --> 19:41.513
Once was when you took early severance,
or bought stocks,

19:41.597 --> 19:43.640
invested in cicada larva mucin,
snail extract…

19:43.724 --> 19:47.060
And Lion's Mane Mushroom granular powder
and germanium bracelets.

19:47.144 --> 19:49.313
I'm telling you, it's not like that!

19:49.396 --> 19:51.899
This is not a drill!

19:52.858 --> 19:57.613
I just saw Lady Trainwreck Eun Chae-ni
being kidnapped with my own two eyes.

19:57.696 --> 20:00.282
Then you should report it to the police.

20:01.366 --> 20:03.076
Go do your homework.

20:04.244 --> 20:05.287
I told you.

20:05.370 --> 20:08.373
I can't do that for reasons
I can't possibly tell you.

20:08.457 --> 20:09.666
Then how about

20:09.750 --> 20:12.252
we get a divorce for reasons
we can't disclose?

20:14.213 --> 20:16.215
Don't be like that, okay?

20:16.715 --> 20:19.218
Why don't we stay
at your father's house for a while--

20:19.301 --> 20:21.261
If you can pay for their new boiler, sure.

20:23.180 --> 20:25.557
There's a large order from the Church.

20:26.516 --> 20:27.351
Say what?

20:28.393 --> 20:31.396
I guess they want to hold
a grand service before the apocalypse.

20:31.480 --> 20:34.024
How romantic.

20:34.524 --> 20:36.443
To perish surrounded by flowers.

20:36.526 --> 20:39.154
No, they're a cult.
We can't get involved. They're harmful.

20:39.238 --> 20:40.072
Dangerous!

20:41.657 --> 20:44.493
The most harmful thing in my life is you.

20:46.245 --> 20:48.288
Aren't you scared of
what might happen to me?

20:48.372 --> 20:49.831
Know what I'm scared of?

20:49.915 --> 20:52.626
Not being able to pay
for Cheong's cram school.

20:53.126 --> 20:56.296
And I'm terrified of our landlord
raising the shop's security deposit.

21:04.263 --> 21:05.138
Is that so?

21:06.139 --> 21:07.015
Am I

21:08.850 --> 21:10.435
that harmful to you?

21:12.521 --> 21:13.981
So that's how it is?

21:15.607 --> 21:16.566
Fine. I get it.

21:17.442 --> 21:18.986
Divorce, did you say?

21:20.237 --> 21:21.321
Let's do it.

21:23.907 --> 21:28.120
Do you think I just put up with everything
because I don't have a temper?

21:28.203 --> 21:31.456
Do I seem weak because I put up
with everything as the man of the house?

21:31.540 --> 21:32.541
Hey, Moon Mi-hui.

21:32.624 --> 21:36.461
I still have some fight left in me.
I'm not finished yet!

21:37.838 --> 21:38.839
Forget it.

21:39.798 --> 21:41.800
While we're at it, let's just end things.

21:42.467 --> 21:45.637
I'm sick and tired of living
so pathetically like this too.

21:45.721 --> 21:47.097
Sick and tired.

22:02.654 --> 22:05.699
Keep it down!

22:25.635 --> 22:29.306
-Everything will be fine if I just die?
-It keeps sticking.

22:31.641 --> 22:33.852
If I die,

22:35.645 --> 22:38.440
the world will change?

22:40.233 --> 22:42.986
Think of it as paying
for your grandmother's sins.

22:44.988 --> 22:46.156
Who are you?

22:46.239 --> 22:47.866
In any case,

22:48.367 --> 22:51.661
you lived the past 20 years
thanks to your rich grandmother.

22:51.745 --> 22:53.538
Are these

22:55.082 --> 22:57.000
my own thoughts?

22:58.043 --> 23:00.128
So if you can hear me, answer me.

23:01.546 --> 23:02.547
Tell me that you'll…

23:05.092 --> 23:06.176
die for us.

23:11.348 --> 23:13.266
For you…

23:14.518 --> 23:15.769
Die…

23:19.564 --> 23:20.399
gladly.

23:22.776 --> 23:24.319
Gladly…

23:37.624 --> 23:38.667
Die!

24:36.558 --> 24:38.435
I can't see anything.

24:38.518 --> 24:39.352
Seriously?

24:39.436 --> 24:42.397
-Just tell me how.
-Why are you wearing those?

24:42.481 --> 24:45.066
You can't see
because you're wearing these!

24:45.150 --> 24:46.776
That hurts!

24:46.860 --> 24:49.613
Hey, I'm not stupid.
I'm telling you, I can take these off.

24:49.696 --> 24:52.949
-For crying out loud.
-Just tell me to take them off.

24:58.997 --> 25:00.123
Is Eunie well?

25:00.749 --> 25:03.043
Tell her it's time to move back home,
if she can.

25:03.126 --> 25:05.170
She can stop being mad at me later.

25:05.253 --> 25:06.338
Sure.

25:06.838 --> 25:07.672
Sorry?

25:09.382 --> 25:10.550
Yes, ma'am.

25:12.761 --> 25:16.264
She's lost her mind.
Did she sleep at Master's house or what?

25:16.348 --> 25:18.725
I packed some food,
so take it and go home.

25:18.808 --> 25:20.227
She must be bored alone.

25:20.310 --> 25:21.144
I'll be back.

25:22.771 --> 25:24.064
See you later.

25:25.732 --> 25:26.816
Goodbye, ma'am.

25:28.318 --> 25:30.779
-What's going on?
-Did something happen?

25:30.862 --> 25:32.531
Auntie, I'm going out for a bit.

25:32.614 --> 25:33.823
Okay.

25:37.827 --> 25:39.412
You're completely fine.

25:40.080 --> 25:41.456
You didn't get kidnapped.

25:57.764 --> 26:00.976
I'll escort you home
after a hot cup of tea, Madam.

26:01.685 --> 26:05.730
I just need you to tell me where he is.
I really need to see him.

26:05.814 --> 26:08.024
He's overseas,
so you can't see him anyway.

26:08.108 --> 26:11.444
Overseas where? When is he coming back?
I can go to him instead.

26:11.528 --> 26:13.488
I'm not at liberty to disclose that.

26:15.991 --> 26:20.495
An overseas trip with a vague schedule
usually means a trip to the hospital.

26:22.539 --> 26:23.373
Where is he?

26:31.923 --> 26:33.633
It'd be best for you to leave now.

26:33.717 --> 26:35.093
Should I find out for myself?

26:42.058 --> 26:42.892
Yes, it's me.

26:43.393 --> 26:45.770
I found out
who got Ha Won-do out on parole.

26:49.899 --> 26:51.484
It was Chairman Nam Sun-gyu.

26:53.278 --> 26:55.447
He's at the Church
of Eternal Salvation now.

27:08.084 --> 27:10.670
Neither Master nor Chae-ni is answering.

27:12.672 --> 27:13.548
Mr. Son.

27:14.132 --> 27:17.218
Do you think they fell in love
and ran away together?

27:17.302 --> 27:19.054
This is your problem.

27:19.554 --> 27:22.182
That's seriously the genre you see
for those two?

27:22.682 --> 27:27.020
Don't you think a thriller or action film
with a deadly chase is far more likely?

27:28.563 --> 27:30.065
Or a kidnapping.

27:30.148 --> 27:32.233
But neither of them is answering.

27:32.317 --> 27:33.902
They could've spent the night--

27:33.985 --> 27:36.196
The truth is,
I saw Chae-ni being kidnapped.

27:39.240 --> 27:42.494
Turns out Oddball is in league
with the Church of Eternal Salvation.

27:43.411 --> 27:45.789
That jerk totally played us.

27:46.289 --> 27:48.750
There you go with your lying again.

27:56.174 --> 27:58.259
I am Kang Ro-bin.

28:03.014 --> 28:04.849
Oddball kidnapped Chae-ni.

28:05.475 --> 28:07.102
The Wunderkinder and the Church.

28:07.185 --> 28:09.979
He's in league with them
and kidnapped Chae-ni!

28:13.149 --> 28:15.235
What?! What do we do?

28:15.318 --> 28:16.736
What can we do?

28:17.737 --> 28:20.990
We hide.
Stay out of Oddball's sight for a while.

28:21.074 --> 28:23.785
But what about Chae-ni?
You said she was taken.

28:23.868 --> 28:26.413
What if they dissect her or something?

28:26.496 --> 28:27.497
What can we do?

28:28.123 --> 28:29.290
That's her damn fate.

28:30.875 --> 28:33.920
You can't say that, Mr. Son.

28:34.003 --> 28:36.798
We already abandoned Chae-ni once.
You want to do it again?

28:37.590 --> 28:39.968
Then what?
Are you going to fight them alone?

28:41.261 --> 28:42.137
Wait a minute.

28:43.805 --> 28:45.932
I'm going to see Master.
I'll ask him myself.

28:46.015 --> 28:48.017
Just sit down!

28:49.811 --> 28:52.147
You're not coming, are you?
Then I'll go alone.

28:52.230 --> 28:53.940
For heaven's sake.

28:54.023 --> 28:56.234
What could you do?
Are you trying to get killed?

28:56.317 --> 28:57.777
You're the biggest coward ever.

28:58.528 --> 29:01.281
What could you do
when you'd faint before ever saving her?

29:01.364 --> 29:02.949
How could you ever save anyone?

29:06.244 --> 29:07.996
Let go. That's way too hard.

29:08.621 --> 29:09.622
You're right.

29:10.123 --> 29:11.374
I'm a coward

29:11.958 --> 29:12.959
who's slow

29:13.668 --> 29:14.919
and tactless.

29:15.420 --> 29:18.798
Everyone in the world thinks
that I'm nothing but a nuisance.

29:21.217 --> 29:22.677
Everyone except Chae-ni.

29:23.928 --> 29:25.054
Twenty-three!

29:25.555 --> 29:26.931
Twenty-four!

29:27.432 --> 29:28.767
Twenty-five!

29:29.267 --> 29:30.602
Twenty-six!

29:30.685 --> 29:32.270
Twenty-seven!

29:32.771 --> 29:34.147
Twenty-eight!

29:34.647 --> 29:36.107
Twenty-nine!

29:36.691 --> 29:37.692
Thirty!

29:37.776 --> 29:38.860
Oh, come on!

29:39.444 --> 29:41.488
-What the heck?
-What's wrong with him?

29:42.739 --> 29:44.199
What are you doing?

29:44.282 --> 29:45.825
Is this that hard?

29:46.326 --> 29:47.619
Get a hold of yourselves!

29:47.702 --> 29:50.955
-Semester just started. Snap out of it!
-Hey, stop messing up.

29:52.707 --> 29:54.292
Next, 50 times! How many times?

29:54.375 --> 29:55.960
Fifty!

29:56.044 --> 29:57.420
Forty-three!

29:57.921 --> 29:59.088
Forty-four!

29:59.714 --> 30:00.965
Forty-five!

30:01.466 --> 30:02.884
Forty-six!

30:02.967 --> 30:04.260
Forty-seven!

30:05.386 --> 30:06.554
Forty-eight!

30:06.638 --> 30:07.722
Forty-nine!

30:08.556 --> 30:09.641
Fifty!

30:11.017 --> 30:11.976
Hey!

30:21.110 --> 30:22.570
Hey, Sap!

30:23.196 --> 30:24.864
How can you eat right now?

30:25.907 --> 30:27.742
Enjoy your meals, guys. I'm sorry.

30:29.786 --> 30:30.954
You idiot.

30:31.621 --> 30:33.498
-This looks good.
-Yeah, enjoy.

30:35.124 --> 30:36.417
Enjoy your meals.

30:38.628 --> 30:40.255
-Eat up.
-Hey, this is good.

30:56.855 --> 30:58.106
This fried egg is good.

31:00.024 --> 31:01.568
From now on,

31:02.151 --> 31:03.486
you eat lunch with me.

31:03.570 --> 31:05.530
What? Okay.

31:07.490 --> 31:10.618
Hey, Sappy Sap of Class 3. You idiot--

31:10.702 --> 31:11.828
Hey, don't.

31:11.911 --> 31:14.289
-Cut it out.
-I have something to tell you.

31:14.372 --> 31:16.124
Come on. Let's talk.

31:16.207 --> 31:18.251
-Let's go. It'll be quick.
-What is it?

31:23.298 --> 31:24.215
Let's eat.

31:40.982 --> 31:42.817
That was the first time

31:42.901 --> 31:44.277
someone stood by me.

31:44.861 --> 31:46.946
Chae-ni was the first person
to do that for me.

31:48.615 --> 31:50.283
I see, Ro-bin.

31:51.075 --> 31:53.536
But how about you let me go
for such long stories?

31:54.037 --> 31:57.415
It hurts so much. It hurts, okay?

32:00.793 --> 32:02.545
If you're going to hide, go ahead.

32:04.422 --> 32:05.924
Hey, at least eat before you go.

32:06.007 --> 32:08.843
Hey, Chae-ni's grandma
packed this for us. Ro-bin!

32:09.344 --> 32:10.303
Hey!

32:10.386 --> 32:12.347
What? A letter of resignation?

32:12.430 --> 32:15.016
Yeah, he says he's going back to Seoul.

32:15.516 --> 32:19.437
Just like this, out of nowhere,
without a goodbye or a farewell party?

32:19.520 --> 32:23.816
This is why I told you not to warm up
to those cold-hearted city boys, Na-yeong.

32:25.443 --> 32:26.694
Heartless bastard.

32:31.199 --> 32:32.492
You scared me.

32:36.496 --> 32:39.123
See? He never intended to stick around.

32:45.755 --> 32:47.465
That bastard.

32:51.844 --> 32:53.721
Whoa, why? What? Why?

32:53.805 --> 32:54.931
Sir?

32:55.974 --> 32:58.184
Is he really going back to Seoul?

32:58.893 --> 32:59.727
Yes.

33:00.228 --> 33:01.437
He is. Why do you ask?

33:07.193 --> 33:08.069
Did he see?

33:11.364 --> 33:13.282
PLEASE DISPOSE OF THIS

33:42.729 --> 33:43.730
Where's Chae-ni?

33:45.148 --> 33:46.983
Go home. I don't know anything.

33:56.117 --> 33:58.077
There you go, stomping away again!

33:58.661 --> 34:01.873
City Hall guy!
I swear I'll report you to the police!

34:02.623 --> 34:03.875
The truth is,

34:04.917 --> 34:07.211
I've felt strong since earlier.

34:07.879 --> 34:09.422
But I'm just so upset

34:11.174 --> 34:13.801
that I can't seem to lose my strength.

34:21.267 --> 34:23.436
Put me down and let's talk.

34:23.519 --> 34:25.229
Tell me where Chae-ni is first.

34:25.855 --> 34:27.023
What did you do to her?

34:27.648 --> 34:31.027
Master, did you really
hand her over to them?

34:31.110 --> 34:32.361
Did you

34:33.154 --> 34:35.448
really betray us?

35:39.637 --> 35:40.555
Hello?

35:40.638 --> 35:43.891
Hey, Kang Ro-bin, where are you?
Did you go to see Oddball after all?

35:43.975 --> 35:48.771
The owner of Hearty House is going crazy
trying to find you and Chae-ni!

35:52.692 --> 35:54.485
I'm Eun Chae-ni's grandmother.

36:09.083 --> 36:09.959
Go ahead.

36:10.459 --> 36:12.503
I'd like to see you for a moment.

36:13.713 --> 36:15.173
Can you come over?

36:15.673 --> 36:16.841
You're okay, right?

36:16.924 --> 36:19.093
Please tell me you're okay!

36:19.177 --> 36:20.261
Hey! Hello?

36:20.344 --> 36:21.345
Mr. Son.

36:21.429 --> 36:22.763
Please insult me.

36:22.847 --> 36:24.515
Are you listening to me or not?

36:25.016 --> 36:27.476
I swear, you're dead meat when I find you!

37:11.979 --> 37:13.648
EUN CHAE-NI'S BUCKET LIST

37:16.275 --> 37:18.486
1. CLIMB KILIMANJARO
2. SEE THE NORTHERN LIGHTS

37:18.569 --> 37:20.738
3. SEE THE HELLUSION
WHEN THEY COME TO KOREA

37:20.821 --> 37:22.490
AND EXPLORE SEOUL WHILE I'M THERE

37:22.573 --> 37:23.658
4. KISS

37:26.869 --> 37:28.913
5. EAT A WHOLE CAKE
6. RIDE THE EAGLE FORTRESS

37:32.625 --> 37:35.378
9. DATE
10. LIVE PAST 30

37:38.047 --> 37:40.675
LIVE PAST 30

37:42.176 --> 37:45.930
Can I ask you something?

37:49.267 --> 37:51.978
Is Master one of the people

37:53.187 --> 37:54.939
I'd be saving?

37:55.731 --> 37:57.525
Are you referring to 3972?

37:58.484 --> 37:59.610
If so,

38:00.319 --> 38:02.363
you've already saved him.

38:03.072 --> 38:04.657
In return for handing you over,

38:05.157 --> 38:06.742
he got to meet his mom.

38:15.376 --> 38:16.419
What?

38:18.087 --> 38:19.547
If that's the case…

38:21.549 --> 38:23.467
I can't even be mad at him.

38:28.431 --> 38:29.890
His mom?

38:29.974 --> 38:32.268
I can't beat that.

38:45.156 --> 38:47.742
All done. Come out here.

38:54.040 --> 38:56.208
I heard from Eunie

38:57.293 --> 38:58.544
that you're a Wunderkinder.

39:01.839 --> 39:02.673
I'm sorry.

39:04.842 --> 39:06.302
I asked you here

39:06.385 --> 39:09.430
because this may be
my last chance to apologize.

39:12.641 --> 39:13.934
I wanted to make sure

39:15.436 --> 39:17.855
you had a home-cooked meal before leaving.

39:22.818 --> 39:25.738
I know this won't make up for anything,

39:27.073 --> 39:29.367
but I thought it was the least I could do.

39:30.701 --> 39:32.161
As you said,

39:33.662 --> 39:36.165
I don't think a meal
can make up for all those years.

39:38.167 --> 39:39.335
I'll be on my way now.

39:39.418 --> 39:40.920
Where is my Chae-ni?

39:43.839 --> 39:45.257
That's all I ask.

39:46.133 --> 39:47.301
Did you, by any chance,

39:48.135 --> 39:50.346
hand her over to Ha Won-do?

39:52.723 --> 39:56.143
I'm not asking you to save her.
I'll do the saving.

39:56.894 --> 39:59.188
Just tell me where Chae-ni is.

40:00.064 --> 40:01.065
Where is she now?

40:03.859 --> 40:04.735
It might

40:06.153 --> 40:07.154
already be too late.

40:07.238 --> 40:08.155
No.

40:08.656 --> 40:10.116
I know she's hanging in there.

40:11.242 --> 40:15.079
My baby doesn't go down that easily.
I know because she's my baby.

40:22.545 --> 40:23.379
My apologies.

40:36.600 --> 40:38.561
So he actually came when she asked.

40:39.145 --> 40:40.229
That traitor.

40:41.480 --> 40:43.983
And I guess you came
when asked, too, Mr. Son.

40:44.483 --> 40:45.734
You said you'd be hiding.

40:47.027 --> 40:47.862
Hey.

40:52.616 --> 40:53.534
What's going on?

40:54.285 --> 40:56.537
Did he already have it out with her?

40:57.037 --> 40:58.456
He's not in bad shape at all.

40:58.539 --> 40:59.373
Master!

41:01.250 --> 41:02.751
Kang Ro-bin, stay out of it!

41:05.337 --> 41:07.840
Where are you going?
Are you going to save Chae-ni?

41:07.923 --> 41:09.800
I bet 10,000 won that he isn't.

41:09.884 --> 41:13.596
-Are you really not going to save her?
-I bet my honor that he definitely won't.

41:20.478 --> 41:23.105
I thought it was all meaningless.

41:31.739 --> 41:33.657
Is that the child?

41:34.241 --> 41:35.075
Yes.

41:39.413 --> 41:41.248
I see.

41:46.921 --> 41:51.133
That it didn't matter to me
whatever happened to someone else's life.

41:51.634 --> 41:52.927
Come on, Master!

41:53.010 --> 41:55.262
You're really gonna run for it,
aren't you?

42:02.728 --> 42:03.812
Such annoying,

42:05.189 --> 42:06.899
bothersome people.

42:08.692 --> 42:09.777
Mr. Oddball.

42:09.860 --> 42:12.655
We get it, all right?
You're not exactly happy to see us.

42:12.738 --> 42:13.781
This guy won't give up!

42:13.864 --> 42:15.407
But we still like you, Master.

42:16.492 --> 42:19.203
Most people don't bother
if they don't want to help.

42:19.286 --> 42:21.455
But even if you don't want to,

42:21.539 --> 42:23.165
you help in the end.

42:23.958 --> 42:24.875
Know why?

42:26.335 --> 42:27.878
Because you're on my side.

42:27.962 --> 42:29.755
Master!

42:30.297 --> 42:31.966
No concept of personal space

42:32.758 --> 42:34.969
in the way they just keep barging in.

42:41.600 --> 42:42.685
I wanted to find her.

42:46.063 --> 42:48.774
And I wanted to know
what it was that I'd lost.

42:53.195 --> 42:54.822
I thought that if I found my mom…

42:59.785 --> 43:01.662
I could turn my life around…

43:04.331 --> 43:06.125
even just a little bit.

43:15.092 --> 43:16.176
That's why.

43:19.346 --> 43:20.598
That's why I…

44:02.306 --> 44:04.183
Such ridiculously…

44:06.018 --> 44:07.227
warm

44:08.729 --> 44:10.147
and friendly people.

44:11.440 --> 44:12.274
Why? What?

44:12.775 --> 44:14.151
Did I tick you off?

44:21.784 --> 44:25.245
What, are you calling the Church?
To tell them to kidnap us too?

44:27.081 --> 44:28.332
I need people.

44:30.000 --> 44:30.876
How many?

44:30.959 --> 44:32.711
The more, the better.

44:33.212 --> 44:34.088
A hundred?

44:35.214 --> 44:36.674
No, make that 200.

44:39.802 --> 44:40.886
You got it.

44:44.682 --> 44:46.058
I'm sorry, Mr. Yang.

44:46.141 --> 44:47.434
Please, just this once.

44:47.518 --> 44:50.646
After you up and left as though you were
never going to see us again?

44:50.729 --> 44:53.857
Guess some people's antisocial tendencies
rubbed off on you.

44:53.941 --> 44:54.817
Anti…

44:54.900 --> 44:56.068
What?

45:03.784 --> 45:04.952
Please.

45:09.707 --> 45:10.874
PUBLIC HOUSING DEPARTMENT

45:12.751 --> 45:16.046
Victory! Get the job done!
Class 560, Yang Seok-u!

45:16.130 --> 45:16.964
Victory!

45:17.673 --> 45:19.425
-What is it?
-Some energy drinks, sir.

45:19.508 --> 45:20.342
Thanks, but--

45:20.426 --> 45:22.469
Allow me to just use your computer.

45:22.553 --> 45:24.638
"Church of…" Stop right there.

45:24.722 --> 45:26.849
You're poking the hornet's nest!
Take this back.

45:26.932 --> 45:29.184
How about some liquor?
Your favorite hard liquor.

45:29.268 --> 45:31.687
-Bomb shots?
-Yes, bomb shots, sir.

45:31.770 --> 45:34.148
-Well, that is…
-Okay, great.

45:34.732 --> 45:36.024
SWEET HOME WELFARE CENTER

45:36.108 --> 45:37.484
CHURCH OF ETERNAL SALVATION

45:37.568 --> 45:39.862
Floor plans
of the Church of Eternal Salvation.

45:41.655 --> 45:42.656
Thank you, Mr. Yang.

45:44.241 --> 45:45.701
So you even smile, huh?

45:45.784 --> 45:48.203
You finally seem human.

45:48.287 --> 45:49.955
I always figured

45:50.038 --> 45:53.500
you had a compartment on your back
to insert batteries or something.

45:58.964 --> 46:01.800
Actually, I'm… the rechargeable kind.

46:08.724 --> 46:09.975
220 volts.

46:22.613 --> 46:24.198
This area is too open.

46:25.324 --> 46:28.994
As for this side, it'll be hard
to secure a route to the drain.

46:35.959 --> 46:38.253
Let's just report it to the cops.

46:38.337 --> 46:41.006
This is beyond our scope.

46:41.089 --> 46:42.174
And what would we say?

46:43.383 --> 46:44.343
Goddammit.

46:44.927 --> 46:47.554
What else? We tell the truth,
whether they believe or not.

46:47.638 --> 46:50.390
Then we'll have done our part,
and we can walk away.

46:51.558 --> 46:52.935
They won't believe us anyway.

46:53.435 --> 46:56.563
The first thing those people do
is silence the police.

46:56.647 --> 46:58.607
All the more reason for us to stay put.

46:58.690 --> 47:01.318
If the police can't do anything about it,
what can we do?

47:01.401 --> 47:03.529
Who are you to get involved?

47:05.405 --> 47:06.698
Chae-ni is my friend!

47:07.825 --> 47:09.409
And I will save her.

47:11.203 --> 47:13.705
So you went from a toddler
to a 30-year-old muscle man,

47:13.789 --> 47:15.624
but what can you actually do?

47:15.707 --> 47:19.586
That superpower just about
puts you on par with other people now.

47:19.670 --> 47:21.839
So what could you possibly do?

47:21.922 --> 47:25.175
You seem to be under the delusion
that you've become something amazing,

47:25.759 --> 47:28.053
but compared to the Wunderkinder,
you're a rookie.

47:28.136 --> 47:29.847
If you value your life,

47:29.930 --> 47:32.683
just stay put and don't get involved.

47:32.766 --> 47:35.143
Even if you get involved,
there's nothing you--

47:45.237 --> 47:47.322
I guess there's a lot you could do.

47:50.701 --> 47:52.661
Now it's time to train in real life.

47:52.744 --> 47:54.371
How can we trust you?

47:55.163 --> 47:57.291
We never know
when you'll become Mr. Curveball.

47:57.374 --> 48:00.002
What if we all go in to save her,
and you change your mind?

48:00.085 --> 48:00.919
Yes, fine.

48:01.003 --> 48:04.506
I know the situation right now
is urgent and desperate,

48:05.007 --> 48:06.925
but should we risk our lives for her?

48:07.009 --> 48:10.846
Hey, Kang Ro-bin, say something.
This just isn't right.

48:10.929 --> 48:12.389
Back the fudge off.

48:13.557 --> 48:15.017
What's with the stink eye?

48:15.100 --> 48:17.978
When you, of all people,
look at me like that,

48:18.061 --> 48:20.856
it makes me feel so darn pathetic.

48:20.939 --> 48:23.734
You do seem pretty darn pathetic.

48:25.110 --> 48:27.446
Let's go, Master. Just us.

48:27.529 --> 48:28.363
Hey.

48:28.447 --> 48:31.074
Wait. Who said I wasn't going?

48:31.158 --> 48:32.409
Okay, fine.

48:33.535 --> 48:34.578
Got it. I'll go.

48:34.661 --> 48:35.954
I'm going.

48:36.455 --> 48:38.081
But on one condition.

48:41.084 --> 48:43.295
We file the police report in my name.

48:47.215 --> 48:48.050
Deal!

49:12.115 --> 49:12.991
HAESEONG CITY HALL

49:25.921 --> 49:27.339
My code name will be

49:27.839 --> 49:30.092
"Condolence Wreath."

49:31.176 --> 49:34.972
Do you think we can get there
before they wrench out Chae-ni's heart?

49:35.722 --> 49:36.640
Enough chatter.

49:37.140 --> 49:40.477
Let's get moving. If we're too late,
this will all have been for nothing.

49:46.650 --> 49:48.026
EUN CHAE-NI

50:40.746 --> 50:41.705
This is infuriating!

50:43.874 --> 50:45.751
What exactly is going on out there?

50:46.293 --> 50:49.296
Why are they keeping us in here
and not letting us go outside?

50:50.130 --> 50:51.339
Know anything, Ju-ran?

50:54.301 --> 50:56.219
I think Father found that child.

50:56.303 --> 50:57.596
That child?

50:59.056 --> 51:01.308
You mean the Child of Eternity?
He found him?

51:04.061 --> 51:06.021
Then why didn't he tell us?

51:06.104 --> 51:08.982
If he found him,
he should have called us first.

51:09.691 --> 51:11.193
Isn't this a bit odd?

51:11.276 --> 51:12.694
Don't you two agree?

51:12.778 --> 51:14.154
I'm sure he has a reason.

51:15.113 --> 51:15.947
Just wait.

51:17.949 --> 51:19.743
You know what Father hates most.

51:20.702 --> 51:22.162
Asking unnecessary questions.

51:28.585 --> 51:30.837
We could listen in another way.

51:36.051 --> 51:37.010
You don't mean…

51:37.594 --> 51:38.512
Are you insane?

51:45.811 --> 51:47.938
-Father.
-I'm busy now. Later.

51:48.021 --> 51:50.315
We heard you found the Child of Eternity.

51:56.530 --> 51:58.115
Please tell us.

51:59.199 --> 52:01.243
Why are you hiding that child from us?

52:01.326 --> 52:03.203
What exactly are you suspecting?

52:10.127 --> 52:11.586
Tell us.

52:12.629 --> 52:14.714
What are you hiding from us?

52:21.930 --> 52:23.265
Answer me.

52:25.475 --> 52:27.227
Please answer me, Father.

52:42.367 --> 52:43.618
"Now faith is

52:45.537 --> 52:47.789
confidence in what we hope for

52:48.290 --> 52:51.251
and assurance about what we do not see."

52:54.671 --> 52:56.131
If you do not have faith in me,

52:56.214 --> 53:00.218
you'll never be able to see
what you hope for, Ju-ran.

53:10.395 --> 53:13.732
You possess the ability
that I love most of all.

53:14.232 --> 53:17.152
It's also the ability I need the most.

53:17.736 --> 53:18.987
But that doesn't mean

53:19.946 --> 53:22.032
you can use it on me.

53:31.208 --> 53:32.959
Elder Yoon has been in touch.

53:33.043 --> 53:35.545
He says there is a crowd gathered
outside the building.

53:35.629 --> 53:37.964
Didn't you hear there's been a problem?

53:39.007 --> 53:39.841
You should go.

53:58.652 --> 54:01.488
You are my daughter of faith, Ju-ran.

54:03.281 --> 54:05.825
As you are my first child,

54:06.993 --> 54:09.246
I will save you before anyone else.

54:11.706 --> 54:12.832
So,

54:12.916 --> 54:15.252
do not test me.

54:16.836 --> 54:20.840
Doubt and distrust
will only rot your bones.

54:25.512 --> 54:26.346
Yes,

54:27.472 --> 54:28.306
Father.

54:44.114 --> 54:46.992
Give us back our families!

54:47.075 --> 54:49.744
Give them back!

54:49.828 --> 54:51.955
Cultists, begone!

54:52.038 --> 54:54.416
Begone!

54:54.499 --> 54:56.626
Give us back our families!

54:56.710 --> 54:58.670
Give them back!

54:58.753 --> 55:00.880
Cultists, begone!

55:00.964 --> 55:02.340
Begone!

55:02.424 --> 55:03.675
Please save them all.

55:03.758 --> 55:06.594
A criminal organization
that brainwashes people!

55:06.678 --> 55:07.846
Leave!

55:07.929 --> 55:09.681
Leave!

55:09.764 --> 55:12.183
-Please save them all.
-Give us back our families!

55:12.267 --> 55:14.686
Give them back!

55:14.769 --> 55:16.730
Cultists, begone!

55:16.813 --> 55:19.065
Begone!

55:19.149 --> 55:20.859
Give us back our families!

55:20.942 --> 55:22.485
Did you contact the police?

55:23.403 --> 55:24.237
Yes.

55:24.321 --> 55:25.905
They said they're on their way.

55:25.989 --> 55:28.199
Begone!

55:28.283 --> 55:30.785
Give us back our families!

55:30.869 --> 55:32.787
Give them back!

55:32.871 --> 55:36.249
-Cultists, begone!
-Begone!

55:36.333 --> 55:40.920
-Give us back our families!
-Give them back!

55:41.421 --> 55:44.215
The Church is a criminal organization
that brainwashes people!

55:44.299 --> 55:47.969
Leave!

55:48.053 --> 55:49.387
All right, everyone!

55:49.471 --> 55:53.183
Let's let them hear our screams, our fury!

56:24.130 --> 56:25.465
Thanks.

56:29.135 --> 56:30.428
I'm Number 4204.

56:35.141 --> 56:36.684
Thanks to the fire that day,

56:37.268 --> 56:39.479
I got out just before
they experimented on me.

56:40.772 --> 56:43.066
There were 20 other kids like me.

56:43.650 --> 56:44.609
Thanks to you,

56:45.402 --> 56:47.112
we're all okay and living our lives.

56:50.240 --> 56:51.449
If you need this…

56:56.663 --> 56:57.580
That's okay.

57:31.781 --> 57:32.949
They're all in.

57:40.081 --> 57:41.249
HAESEONG POLICE STATION

58:14.115 --> 58:15.408
Why did you bring this?

59:08.461 --> 59:09.337
What?

59:35.780 --> 59:37.198
Brother Hyeong-rok.

59:38.157 --> 59:39.534
Brother Su-hyeok!

59:41.786 --> 59:44.455
Come on out already.
I really hate this kind of thing.

59:50.044 --> 59:51.588
I love you. C'mere.

59:57.218 --> 59:59.429
Actually, I don't. So piss off!

01:00:01.014 --> 01:00:02.390
Sorry.

01:00:10.773 --> 01:00:14.569
I won't bother mentioning that this is
all thanks to my flypaper hands.

01:00:15.320 --> 01:00:17.447
Master, which way do we go now?

01:00:19.032 --> 01:00:20.199
Hold on a second.

01:00:22.952 --> 01:00:24.454
There's a door here.

01:00:25.705 --> 01:00:26.581
Come here.

01:00:27.290 --> 01:00:28.750
We can just open it.

01:00:34.797 --> 01:00:36.257
What is it?

01:00:36.758 --> 01:00:37.759
I can't see a thing.

01:00:49.437 --> 01:00:50.521
Hello, sirs.

01:00:52.440 --> 01:00:55.693
Why haven't you disbanded them yet?
Even the police are here.

01:00:56.194 --> 01:00:58.237
We did send some officers--

01:00:58.905 --> 01:01:00.365
OUTDOOR ASSEMBLY PERMIT FORM

01:01:01.407 --> 01:01:03.993
"They're exercising
their right and freedom to assemble."

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:05.662
Explain it like that.

01:01:10.208 --> 01:01:13.252
After all the money
they gobbled up from us?

01:01:18.383 --> 01:01:19.217
What is it?

01:01:21.094 --> 01:01:23.596
We have intruders.

01:01:26.766 --> 01:01:29.602
-Cultists, begone!
-Begone!

01:01:30.186 --> 01:01:32.313
Pal-ho!

01:01:57.296 --> 01:01:59.257
What's that old geezer

01:01:59.757 --> 01:02:01.801
doing over there?

01:02:02.510 --> 01:02:04.137
We'll be transplanting

01:02:04.762 --> 01:02:06.264
your heart into him.

01:02:11.310 --> 01:02:13.938
But you said I'd be saving the world.

01:02:15.898 --> 01:02:17.233
You said…

01:02:19.569 --> 01:02:21.612
that in exchange for my life,

01:02:22.363 --> 01:02:24.699
you could save countless others.

01:02:27.076 --> 01:02:28.327
But you're just

01:02:29.912 --> 01:02:31.998
giving it to that old man?

01:02:34.167 --> 01:02:36.294
No need to feel wronged, child.

01:02:36.794 --> 01:02:39.630
The only truths that exist in this world

01:02:40.339 --> 01:02:42.759
are unfair, unreasonable,

01:02:43.843 --> 01:02:45.928
and unpleasant ones.

01:02:46.971 --> 01:02:48.556
No.

01:02:49.474 --> 01:02:50.850
Still, this isn't

01:02:51.809 --> 01:02:53.770
what you told me earlier.

01:02:54.896 --> 01:02:57.315
Why should I die

01:02:57.899 --> 01:02:59.692
just to save that old man?

01:03:00.193 --> 01:03:01.027
Why?

01:03:01.527 --> 01:03:02.904
Because you

01:03:03.488 --> 01:03:04.989
are nothing.

01:03:12.705 --> 01:03:13.998
Die.

01:03:14.874 --> 01:03:16.709
Die…

01:03:18.377 --> 01:03:19.378
Gladly.

01:03:23.424 --> 01:03:24.675
Gladly…

01:03:27.553 --> 01:03:29.597
But I don't want to die.

01:03:35.311 --> 01:03:36.562
Why…

01:03:37.522 --> 01:03:40.107
Why am I nothing?

01:03:41.943 --> 01:03:43.319
I am

01:03:44.862 --> 01:03:46.072
my grandma's…

01:03:48.491 --> 01:03:51.118
entire world.

01:03:53.663 --> 01:03:54.997
And I'm Ro-bin's…

01:03:57.708 --> 01:04:01.379
one and only friend.

01:04:04.173 --> 01:04:06.008
And I'm Mr. Son's…

01:04:08.886 --> 01:04:11.180
adrenaline kick.

01:04:13.224 --> 01:04:14.642
And

01:04:16.352 --> 01:04:17.478
Master.

01:04:22.525 --> 01:04:24.610
I'm Master's…

01:04:40.376 --> 01:04:42.003
I'm Master's…

01:05:11.532 --> 01:05:13.326
I'm not wild about the idea, but you're

01:05:14.952 --> 01:05:15.828
on my side.

01:05:43.481 --> 01:05:44.482
Where is she?

01:05:44.565 --> 01:05:45.441
Is that her?

01:05:45.524 --> 01:05:47.068
Hey, is that white thing Chae-ni?

01:05:47.151 --> 01:05:48.361
Chae-ni!

01:05:48.861 --> 01:05:51.364
-Chae-ni!
-Eun Chae-ni!

01:05:51.948 --> 01:05:53.783
-Chae-ni.
-Oh no, what do we do?

01:05:53.866 --> 01:05:56.035
Chae-ni! Are you conscious or not?

01:05:56.118 --> 01:05:58.746
It's me, Mr. Son. Are you okay?

01:05:59.705 --> 01:06:00.623
-Chae-ni!
-Oh no!

01:06:01.207 --> 01:06:04.001
-Chae-ni!
-Get this damn thing out of my face.

01:06:05.962 --> 01:06:07.129
Have we untied her?

01:06:09.423 --> 01:06:10.841
Stop!

01:06:15.054 --> 01:06:16.222
What was that?

01:06:20.351 --> 01:06:21.227
Mr. Son, hurry!

01:06:21.310 --> 01:06:22.645
-What do we do?
-Hurry up!

01:06:22.728 --> 01:06:23.688
What's going on?

01:06:25.064 --> 01:06:27.650
What do we do? Give that to me. All right!

01:06:29.610 --> 01:06:31.320
Hello. Call me Moon Mi-hui.

01:06:40.997 --> 01:06:42.790
-Here!
-Ro-bin!

01:06:55.636 --> 01:06:57.138
You bastard!

01:07:14.030 --> 01:07:15.781
-Chae-ni, are you okay?
-You okay?

01:07:16.657 --> 01:07:19.285
Damn you, Lady Trainwreck!

01:07:19.368 --> 01:07:20.536
My eyes!

01:07:21.078 --> 01:07:22.747
I can't see!

01:07:33.007 --> 01:07:34.467
Hey, catch her!

01:08:26.435 --> 01:08:28.479
I guess you felt a little bad.

01:08:29.063 --> 01:08:30.773
I'm not saving you for your sake

01:08:31.565 --> 01:08:33.567
but for theirs.

01:08:36.987 --> 01:08:38.697
Because when you hold a grudge,

01:08:40.324 --> 01:08:41.534
you're persistent.

01:08:43.494 --> 01:08:45.955
Why don't you get out of my face, then?

01:08:46.038 --> 01:08:47.456
Before I really hold a grudge.

01:08:54.213 --> 01:08:55.047
No.

01:09:08.018 --> 01:09:10.437
Did she really poke my eyes out
or something?

01:09:10.938 --> 01:09:12.481
What am I seeing?

01:09:18.946 --> 01:09:20.281
You go, Ms. Eun Chae-ni.

01:09:21.699 --> 01:09:22.658
To a safe place.

01:09:42.720 --> 01:09:44.180
-Of course.
-Again.

01:09:45.514 --> 01:09:46.432
Of course.

01:09:55.107 --> 01:09:56.817
What… What's this?

01:10:05.367 --> 01:10:07.745
How could Lady Trainwreck
disappear all by herself?

01:10:07.828 --> 01:10:10.497
This is why they say
people bite the hands who feed

01:10:10.581 --> 01:10:12.458
or desert the friends who save you.

01:10:16.879 --> 01:10:20.341
Mr. Son. If you're scared,
just hurl insults at me from behind.

01:10:21.383 --> 01:10:22.676
You bastard, son of a bitch.

01:10:22.760 --> 01:10:26.013
You potato-looking sap
with your corduroy pants. That do it?

01:11:14.144 --> 01:11:17.564
But you're nothing.

01:11:18.524 --> 01:11:19.441
No.

01:11:20.317 --> 01:11:22.194
It's not that I'm nothing.

01:11:22.987 --> 01:11:25.489
I just haven't done anything yet.

01:14:55.824 --> 01:15:00.829
Subtitle translation by: Jimin Choi
